<title>JAPAN: HOSIDEN, PHILIPS TO SET UP LCD VENTURE IN JAPAN.</title>
<headline>HOSIDEN, PHILIPS TO SET UP LCD VENTURE IN JAPAN.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hosiden Corp said on Friday that it and a unit of Philips Electronics NV  had agreed to set up a joint venture in Japan for liquid crystal display (LCD) business.</p>
</text>
